USE `dutyfree`;

INSERT INTO `products`
(`name`, `image`, `description`, `price`, `is_customizable`, `tag`) 
VALUES
('Travel Diary', '/static/images/book.png', 'Take notes about the best places you see during your travel!\nThis beautiful notebook is made by some of the best masters of paper production.', 15, FALSE, 'gift'),

('Pink Gold Bracelet', '/static/images/bracelet.png', 'This exquisite pink gold bracelet is a testament to refined simplicity. Crafted from lustrous pink gold, its delicate design offers a subtle yet captivating shimmer. Perfect for everyday wear or special occasions, it\'s a versatile piece that effortlessly complements any style. A timeless treasure, designed to be cherished.', 1337, FALSE, 'jewelry'),

('Hard Candies', '/static/images/candies.png', 'Experience a burst of concentrated sweetness with our delightful collection of hard candies. Each piece is a tiny gem of pure flavor, crafted to dissolve slowly, allowing you to savor every vibrant note.\nFrom classic fruit explosions to refreshing minty sensations, and even unique gourmet blends, there\'s a hard candy to tantalize every palate.\nIndividually wrapped for freshness and perfect for on-the-go enjoyment, our hard candies are a simple pleasure that brings a smile to your day. Discover your new favorite sweet escape!', 10, FALSE, 'food'),

('Traditional Chocolate Candy', '/static/images/chocolate.png', 'Savor the rich, comforting taste of classic chocolate. Crafted with premium cocoa and time-honored recipes, each piece delivers pure, velvety satisfaction. A perfect everyday treat or cherished gift. Rediscover the simple joy of chocolate.', 3, FALSE, 'food'),

('Grandma\'s Cookies', '/static/images/cookies.png', 'Experience pure comfort with our cookies, baked just like Grandma used to make. Each bite is a warm, nostalgic hug, crafted with her cherished, time-honored recipe and the finest ingredients.\nSimple, wholesome, and bursting with homemade flavor – they\'re a little piece of happiness, straight from our oven to your heart. Just like Grandma\'s, every time.', 8, FALSE, 'food'),

('Diamond Horse', '/static/images/horse.png', 'You can BET this is the best ornament for your house!\nElevate your space with this breathtaking horse decor, a true masterpiece of elegance and artistry. Crafted with meticulous detail, its form is gracefully adorned with a scattering of genuine, brilliant diamonds, catching every ray of light with dazzling sparkle.\nA symbol of strength and beauty, this piece is more than decor—it\'s a radiant statement of unparalleled luxury and refined taste. Bring home a touch of equine majesty, encrusted with timeless brilliance.', 1337, FALSE, 'jewelry'),

('Custom Bottle Opener', '/static/images/m0lecon.png', 'You always need a way to open your refreshing, absolutely non-alcoholic, drink.\nCustomize your bottle opener with any text. The quality is insane, we provide bottle openers to the best cybersecurity events!', 5, TRUE, 'gift'),

('Neck Pillow', '/static/images/neck_pillow.png', 'Transform your travels with ultimate neck support and comfort. Crafted from luxurious, pressure-relieving memory foam, it cradles you into restful relaxation. Lightweight, ergonomic, and perfectly portable for any journey. Your essential companion for blissful comfort, anywhere.', 20, FALSE, 'gift'),

('Gold tag', '/static/images/necklace.png', 'Carry what truly matters close to your heart with our exquisite gold dog tag necklace. Crafted from radiant, genuine gold, this timeless piece offers the ultimate in personal expression.\nEngrave names, dates, meaningful symbols, or a special message to create a unique tribute that\'s distinctly yours.\nDurable, elegant, and deeply personal, it\'s more than just jewelry—it\'s a cherished keepsake, celebrating the bonds that define you. Customize your story, in radiant gold.', 70, TRUE, 'jewelry'),

('Semolina Pasta', '/static/images/pasta.png', 'Elevate your culinary creations with our exquisite semolina pasta, crafted for that perfect al dente bite.\nMade from 100% high-quality durum wheat semolina, each strand and shape boasts a golden hue and a subtly rough texture that eagerly embraces every sauce.\nFrom robust ragùs to delicate pestos, our pasta provides an authentic, satisfying foundation for any dish. Taste the tradition, feel the difference – a true Italian experience in every mouthful.', 5, FALSE, 'food'),

('Space Pen', '/static/images/pen.png', 'Experience the pinnacle of writing technology with our Astronaut Space Pen. Engineered to perform in zero gravity, underwater, and extreme temperatures, this isn\'t just a pen – it\'s a testament to human ingenuity.\nWhether you\'re a budding astronaut or an everyday adventurer, this durable and elegant instrument will elevate your writing to new frontiers.', 134, FALSE, 'jewelry'),

('Puzzo di CTF - Eau de Parfum', '/static/images/perfume.png', 'The unmistakable odor you will for sure experience at the end of this day. Even when you go out with friends, or on a date with your partner, smell like you just fulled your category!', 1333, FALSE, 'gift'),

('Blank shirt', '/static/images/shirt.png', 'Finally, a shirt as reliable as that one piece of luggage you actually got back. Our premium blank tee is a testament to understated style and ultimate comfort – no flashy logos, no questionable patterns, just pure, unadulterated wearability. Perfect for those who appreciate simplicity.', 16, FALSE, 'gift'),

('Snow Globe', '/static/images/snow_globe.png', 'Escape to a miniature wonderland with our "Instant Serenity" Snow Globe. Each delicate flake dances within a tranquil scene, creating a captivating display that brings a moment of peace to any day.\nPerfect for desk decoration, thoughtful gifts, or simply a quick, mesmerizing escape from the everyday hustle and bustle. Just give it a shake and watch your worries drift away.', 23, TRUE, 'gift'),

('Second Cheapest Wine', '/static/images/wine.png', 'Why settle for the bottom of the barrel when you can elevate your evening without breaking the bank? Introducing our "Smart Sip" Special – the second-cheapest wine on the menu, and frankly, the smartest choice you\'ll make all day.\nIt\'s got all the delightful notes of "I\'m being fiscally responsible," perfectly balanced with hints of "I\'m still enjoying myself." A guaranteed crowd-pleaser that proves good taste doesn\'t have to cost a fortune. Cheers to savvy sips!', 16, FALSE, 'food'),

('Red Soda Can', '/static/images/red_can.png', 'Tired of generic sips? Make your thirst personal with our Custom Soda! This classic, vibrant red-labeled can holds a refreshing, fizzy beverage that\'s all your own. Simply tell us your name, and we\'ll print it boldly on the label, making every pop of the tab uniquely yours.\nPerfect for parties, gifts, or just enjoying a drink that finally knows you by name.', 2, TRUE, 'food');
